! 1 · An underline that used to reach the end of the file

Prose naming __localVar in passing. Everything below this line must read as ordinary
paragraph text — no underline, no bleed. (#8)

! 2 · A doubled apostrophe inside a triple-quoted attribute

<$basic-table
  columns="""
    [ { field: 'tags', fmt: (r) => r.tags.join(', ') },
      ...$tw.wiki.getTiddlerText('$:/config/x', '') ]
  """
/>

Everything below this line must read as ordinary paragraph text — no bold, no bleed. (#47, #14)

! 3 · An unquoted attribute value carrying parentheses

<$button actions=doThing(now) class=tc-btn>Go</$button>

`doThing(now)` must read as one attribute value; `(now)` must not become a second
attribute name.

! 4 · TiddlyWiki 5.4.0 constructs

\parsermode block

