<$text text=((myVar)) other=[[a bracket string]] />

<<myProc first=<<inner>> second={{{ [tag[x]] }}} third=`sub` >>

```text/vnd.tiddlywiki
A fenced block whose language identifier now resolves: ''this reads as wikitext''.
```

